<title>USA: Yahoo! forms global alliance with Visa.</title>
<headline>Yahoo! forms global alliance with Visa.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yahoo! Inc said Tuesday it formed a new global electronic commerce alliance with Visa International and restated its second quarter results to reflect a one-time non-cash charge.</p>
<p>The Internet search and navigation company said it had issued 466,321 shares of Yahoo! common stock to the Visa Group and has recorded a related one-time, non-cash pre-tax charge of $21,245,000 in its second quarter to June 30.</p>
</text>
